three-way clean games: 5,333 over 386 dates
equivalence margin delta = 1.0e-3 (pre-stated; D2)
d_min and MDE are printed x1000; MDE at alpha=.05, power=80% (power.py)
EQUIV and a significant z can co-occur and do not contradict: at this n a
gap far too small to matter is still detectable. TOST answers 'is it small',
DM answers 'is it zero'; the paper's claim is the first one.

