  Read: the quotes are essentially simultaneous with the bell and the
  consensus is essentially always the full book panel, so no quality
  filter is applied and none would change the sample materially. The
  book leg is the one with a real timing caveat (30-min snapshot
  bucketing, sportsbook_hist), and it is conceded in the limitations.

